config BR2_PACKAGE_PLEXOS_PLEX_KEYRING
	bool "plexos-plex-keyring"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_GNUPG2
	select BR2_PACKAGE_GNUPG2_GPGV
	help
	  Plex Inc.'s OpenPGP public key, pinned into /usr.

	  ADR-0010 has the appliance download Plex Media Server from Plex's
	  own servers at first boot and verify the signature on what
	  arrives. A key fetched at the same time as the artefact it
	  vouches for proves nothing, so this one ships in the image:
	  /usr is read-only and verified by dm-verity, which makes
	  replacing the key as hard as replacing the OS.

	  Selects gpgv, because a pinned key with nothing able to read it
	  would be an image that looks provisioned for verification and
	  silently is not.
